eated_at\":\"2026-08-31T01:19:42Z\",\"commit_id\":\"0383892256c226cd46b9f6b840ab704b0a4900a2\",\"title\":\"**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Map combination recents to the space table**\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/nucleum/pull/570#discussion_r3891122429\"},{\"id\":3891122431,\"user\":\"chatgpt-codex-connector[bot]\",\"path\":\"client/components/settings/DataSettings.svelte\",\"line\":66,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-31T01:19:42Z\",\"commit_id\":\"0383892256c226cd46b9f6b840ab704b0a4900a2\",\"title\":\"**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Disable E2EE setup in sync-direct mode**\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/nucleum/pull/570#discussion_r3891122431\"},{\"id\":3891122432,\"user\":\"chatgpt-codex-connector[bot]\",\"path\":\"client/components/settings/sync/SyncSettings.svelte\",\"line\":28,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-31T01:19:42Z\",\"commit_id\":\"0383892256c226cd46b9f6b840ab704b0a4900a2\",\"title\":\"**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Recompute network state after reconnecting**\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/nucleum/pull/570#discussion_r3891122432\"},{\"id\":3891138516,\"user\":\"coderabbitai[bot]\",\"path\":\"client/layout/layers/cache/InMemoryCache.svelte\",\"line\":20,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-31T01:25:45Z\",\"commit_id\":\"0383892256c226cd46b9f6b840ab704b0a4900a2\",\"title\":\"_🎯 Functional Correctness_ | _🟡 Minor_ | _⚡ Quick win_\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/nucleum/pull/570#discussion_r3891138516\"},{\"id\":3891138521,\"user\":\"coderabbitai[bot]\",\"path\":\"client/stores/uiState/uiState.store.ts\",\"line\":182,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-31T01:25:45Z\",\"commit_id\":\"0383892256c226cd46b9f6b840ab704b0a4900a2\",\"title\":\"_🎯 Functional Correctness_ | _🟡 Minor_ | _⚡ Quick win_\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/nucleum/pull/570#discussion_r3891138521\"},{\"id\":3891139645,\"user\":\"pullfrog[bot]\",\"path\":\"client/layout/layers/AuthGuard.svelte\",\"line\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-31T01:26:09Z\",\"commit_id\":\"91a40ab57f575d1eed347dcb7a09f9555b21f510\",\"title\":\"Addressed in 03838922 by allowing cached-cloud startup unless a known stored plan is non-Nucleum.\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/nucleum/pull/570#discussion_r3891139645\"},{\"id\":3891146946,\"user\":\"pullfrog[bot]\",\"path\":\"client/persistence/legacyLocalDataBackup.ts\",\"line\":1235,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-31T01:28:47Z\",\"commit_id\":\"0383892256c226cd46b9f6b840ab704b0a4900a2\",\"title\":\"Sessionless `PointLog` rows now receive a `sessionId`, but the import payload never creates the corresponding `session`. The remote schema enforces this required foreign key, and legacy streak rows concretely omit `sessionId`, so their recovery can fail instead of preserving them.\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/nucleum/pull/570#discussion_r3891146946\"},{\"id\":3891146948,\"user\":\"pullfrog[bot]\",\"path\":\"client/stores/datafn.store.ts\",\"line\":871,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-31T01:28:47Z\",\"commit_id\":\"0383892256c226cd46b9f6b840ab704b0a4900a2\",\"title\":\"If disabled metadata was written, clone-up fails, and this restore write also fails, the live context and local settings have already returned to E2EE while remote authority remains disabled. The next online initialization trusts that remote value and can open encrypted local data without a provider.\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/nucleum/pull/570#discussion_r3891146948\"},{\"id\":3891146954,\"user\":\"pullfrog[bot]\",\"path\":\"client/stores/preferences/preferences.store.ts\",\"line\":74,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-31T01:28:47Z\",\"commit_id\":\"0383892256c226cd46b9f6b840ab704b0a4900a2\",\"title\":\"The value comparison cannot distinguish two in-flight saves of the same key and value. If the first fails after the second is registered, its rollback deletes the newer pending entry and restores stale signal state until 