{"timestamp":"2026-08-31T02:00:18.370Z","ordinal":7303,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a053e7-239f-7703-8a5b-d9d8ac22d6de","turn_id":"01a0557b-1a4c-7750-9306-9fc2c690f4cd","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_07a651664efba6ab016a94e030c4b887d08703ef614801175a","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The narrow fix is clear. I’ll make production-only edits: await a verifiable download handoff, reject failed file mutations, treat every non-usable auth resolution as expired for extension gates, restore timezone capture once DataFn is initialized, and omit the legacy empty-objective sentinel while simplifying the now-nonnullable timestamps."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788141616783,"completed_at_ms":1788141618370}}
