{"timestamp":"2026-08-31T02:04:16.359Z","ordinal":7506,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a053e7-239f-7703-8a5b-d9d8ac22d6de","turn_id":"01a0557b-1a4c-7750-9306-9fc2c690f4cd","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_07a651664efba6ab016a94e11bba0087d0b98e4fc77098de56","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Pushed PR #570 fix batch as `8739a79c`.\n\nFixed:\n\n- Await and validate native legacy-backup delivery.\n- Reject failed DataFn file metadata mutations.\n- Restore automatic timezone-change capture.\n- Reject unavailable/signed-out extension sessions.\n- Remove `PointGoal:Empty` invalid objective references.\n- Remove two impossible timestamp comparisons flagged by code quality.\n\nAlready fixed: synthetic sessions for sessionless legacy `PointLog` rows were added in `ce677ed4`.\n\nValidation:\n\n- All four app checks: zero errors.\n- Unit tests: 248 passed, 3 skipped.\n- Prettier and `git diff --check`: clean.\n- Local, upstream, and live PR heads match.\n- Worktree clean.\n\nNo fixture was added because repository policy prohibits modifying existing tests for bug fixes. I also did not refetch reviews or merge after this push—the bounded Skillplane workflow requires the new head’s reviewers to finish before the next fresh refetch round.\n\n"}],"phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":{"entries":[{"path":"MEMORY.md","lineStart":927,"lineEnd":934,"note":"bounded refetch workflow and exact review surfaces"},{"path":"MEMORY.md","lineStart":358,"lineEnd":370,"note":"TIDY-442 stack context and live revalidation"}],"rolloutIds":["01a04890-98cd-7052-8c05-55d02d597ecb"]}},"started_at_ms":1788141851762,"completed_at_ms":1788141856359}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-31T02:04:16.361Z","ordinal":7507,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_07a651664efba6ab016a94e11bba0087d0b98e4fc77098de56","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Pushed PR #570 fix batch as `8739a79c`.\n\nFixed:\n\n- Await and validate native legacy-backup delivery.\n- Reject failed DataFn file metadata mutations.\n- Restore automatic timezone-change capture.\n- Reject unavailable/signed-out extension sessions.\n- Remove `PointGoal:Empty` invalid objective references.\n- Remove two impossible timestamp comparisons flagged by code quality.\n\nAlready fixed: synthetic sessions for sessionless legacy `PointLog` rows were added in `ce677ed4`.\n\nValidation:\n\n- All four app checks: zero errors.\n- Unit tests: 248 passed, 3 skipped.\n- Prettier and `git diff --check`: clean.\n- Local, upstream, and live PR heads match.\n- Worktree clean.\n\nNo fixture was added because repository policy prohibits modifying existing tests for bug fixes. I also did not refetch reviews or merge after this push—the bounded Skillplane workflow requires the new head’s reviewers to finish before the next fresh refetch round.\n\n<oai-mem-citation>\n<citation_entries>\nMEMORY.md:927-934|note=[bounded refetch workflow and exact review surfaces]\nMEMORY.md:358-370|note=[TIDY-442 stack context and live revalidation]\n</citation_entries>\n<rollout_ids>\n01a04890-98cd-7052-8c05-55d02d597ecb\n</rollout_ids>\n</oai-mem-citation>"}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0557b-1a4c-7750-9306-9fc2c690f4cd","content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}}}
