{"timestamp":"2026-08-31T02:04:16.561Z","ordinal":7509,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","turn_id":"01a0557b-1a4c-7750-9306-9fc2c690f4cd","last_agent_message":"Pushed PR #570 fix batch as `8739a79c`.\n\nFixed:\n\n- Await and validate native legacy-backup delivery.\n- Reject failed DataFn file metadata mutations.\n- Restore automatic timezone-change capture.\n- Reject unavailable/signed-out extension sessions.\n- Remove `PointGoal:Empty` invalid objective references.\n- Remove two impossible timestamp comparisons flagged by code quality.\n\nAlready fixed: synthetic sessions for sessionless legacy `PointLog` rows were added in `ce677ed4`.\n\nValidation:\n\n- All four app checks: zero errors.\n- Unit tests: 248 passed, 3 skipped.\n- Prettier and `git diff --check`: clean.\n- Local, upstream, and live PR heads match.\n- Worktree clean.\n\nNo fixture was added because repository policy prohibits modifying existing tests for bug fixes. I also did not refetch reviews or merge after this push—the bounded Skillplane workflow requires the new head’s reviewers to finish before the next fresh refetch round.\n\n","started_at":1788140526,"completed_at":1788141856,"duration_ms":1330340,"time_to_first_token_ms":3691}}
