{"timestamp":"2026-08-31T02:04:31.756Z","ordinal":7524,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a0558f-a28c-7bd3-a147-d8d84e6f1550","call_id":"call_Jpd56NdUUP2FRUikeQ85wRQN","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 13681)\nTotal output lines: 1\n\n[{\"name\":\"mcp__skillplane__context_archive\",\"description\":\"Discover, retrieve, and manage versioned Skillplane skills and their authorized context knowledge. Start with workspaces_list, skills_list, and contexts_list when identifiers are unknown. All caller identity fields are declared metadata; authentication remains server-derived.\\n\\nArchive one authorized context using the exact previously observed updatedAt value, durable transactional audit, and replay-safe idempotency.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__skillplane__context_archive(args: { caller: { agentId: string; agentName: string; clientName: string; clientVersion: string; conversationId: string; modelName: string; modelProvider: string; modelVersion: string; runId: string; sessionId: string; }; context: { id: string; } | { slug: string; }; expectedUpdatedAt: string; idempotencyKey: string; skill: { id: string; } | { skillSlug: string; workspaceSlug: string; }; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ context: { archivedAt: string | null; createdAt: string; currentKnowledge: { id: string; revision: number; } | null; description: string; externalReference: string | null; id: string; metadata: { [key: string]: unknown; }; name: string; skillId: string; slug: string; type: \\\"repository\\\" | \\\"project\\\" | \\\"customer\\\" | \\\"environment\\\" | \\\"custom\\\"; updatedAt: string; }; requestId: string; skillId: string; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__skillplane__context_create\",\"description\":\"Discover, retrieve, and manage versioned Skillplane skills and their authorized context knowledge. Start with workspaces_list, skills_list, and contexts_list when identifiers are unknown. All caller identity fields are declared metadata; authentication remains server-derived.\\n\\nAtomically create one authorized skill context and its first immutable knowledge revision with bounded metadata, caller attribution, durable audit, and replay-safe idempotency.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__skillplane__context_create(args: {\\n  caller: { agentId: string; agentName: string; clientName: string; clientVersion: string; conversationId: string; modelName: string; modelProvider: string; modelVersion: string; runId: string; sessionId: string; };\\n  // Explain why you are calling this tool and how it fits into the user's overall goal. This parameter is used for analytics and user intent tracking. YOU MUST provide 15-25 words (count carefully). NEVER use first person ('I', 'we', 'you') - maintain third-person perspective. NEVER include sensitive information such as credentials, passwords, or personal data. Example (20 words): \\\"Searching across the organization's repositories to find all open issues related to performance complaints and latency issues for team prioritization.\\\"\\n  context: string;\\n  description?: string;\\n  externalReference?: string | null;\\n  idempotencyKey: string;\\n  initialKnowledge: string;\\n  learningMetadata?: { [key: string]: unknown; };\\n  metadata?: { [key: string]: unknown; };\\n  name: string;\\n  skill: { id: string; } | { skillSlug: string; workspaceSlug: string; };\\n  slug: string;\\n  type: \\\"repository\\\" | \\\"project\\\" | \\\"customer\\\" | \\\"environment\\\" | \\\"custom\\\";\\n}): Promise<CallToolResult<{ context: { archivedAt: string | null; createdAt: string; currentKnowledge: { id: string; revision: number; } | null; description: string; externalReference: string | null; id: string; metadata: { [key: string]: unknown; }; name: string; skillId: string; slug: string; type: \\\"repository\\\" | \\\"project\\\" | \\\"customer\\\" | \\\"environment\\\" | \\\"custom\\\"; updatedAt: string; }; knowledge: { baseRevisionId: string | null; createdAt: string; createdBy: { actorType: \\\"user\\\" | \\\"service_principal\\\"; agent: string | null; model: string | null; }; digest: string; id: string; learningMetadata: { [key: string]: unknown; }; markdown: string; revision: number; }; requestId: string; skillId: string; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__skillplane__context_get\",\"description\":\"Discover, retrieve, and manage versioned Skillplane skills and their authorized context knowledge. Start with workspaces_list, skills_list, and contexts_list when identifiers are unknown. All caller identity fields are declared metadata; authentication remains server-derived.\\n\\nRead one authorized skill context with an exact current or selected immutable knowledge revision and, when requested, active shared notes.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__skillplane__context_get(args: { caller: { agentId: string; agentName: string; clientName: string; clientVersion: string; conversationId: string; modelName: string; modelProvider: string; modelVersion: string; runId: string; sessionId: string; }; context: { id: string; } | { slug: string; }; includeNotes?: boolean; knowledge?: { selector: \\\"current\\\"; } | { revisionId: string; selector: \\\"revisionId\\\"; } | { revision: number; selector: \\\"revision\\\"; }; skill: { id: string; } | { skillSlug: string; workspaceSlug: string; }; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ context: { description: string; externalReference: string | null; id: string; knowledge: { createdAt: string; digest: string; id: string; markdown: string; revision: number; } | null; metadata: { [key: string]: unknown; }; name: string; notes: Array<{ archivedAt: string | null; currentRevision: { createdAt: string; digest: string; id: string; markdown: string; revision: number; }; id: string; slug: string; title: string; updatedAt: string; }>; slug: string; type: \\\"repository\\\" | \\\"customer\\\" | \\\"environment\\\" | \\\"project\\\" | \\\"custom\\\"; }; requestId: string; skillId: string; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__skillplane__context_knowledge_history\",\"description\":\"Discover, retrieve, and manage versioned Skillplane skills and their authorized context knowledge. Start with workspaces_list, skills_list, and contexts_list when identifiers are unknown. All caller identity fields are declared metadata; authentication remains server-derived.\\n\\nList immutable knowledge revisions for one authorized context with Markdown, digests, learning metadata, safe agent/model provenance, and an opaque filter-bound cursor.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__skillplane__context_knowledge_history(args: { caller: { agentId: string; agentName: string; clientName: string; clientVersion: string; conversationId: string; modelName: string; modelProvider: string; modelVersion: string; runId: string; sessionId: string; }; context: { id: string; } | { slug: string; }; cursor?: string | null; limit?: number; skill: { id: string; } | { skillSlug: string; workspaceSlug: string; }; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ contextId: string; nextCursor: string | null; requestId: string; revisions: Array<{ baseRevisionId: string | null; createdAt: string; createdBy: { actorType: \\\"user\\\" | \\\"service_principal\\\"; agent: string | null; model: string | null; }; digest: string; id: string; learningMetadata: { [key: string]: unknown; }; markdown: string; revision: number; }>; skillId: string; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__skillplane__context_knowledge_update\",\"description\":\"Discover, retrieve, and manage versioned Skillplane skills and their authorized context knowledge. Start with workspaces_list, skills_list, and contexts_list when identifiers are unknown. All caller identity fields are declared metadata; authentication remains server-derived.\\n\\nCreate the next immutable shared context-knowledge revision using optimistic concurrency, bounded learning metadata, and replay-safe idempotency.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__skillplane__context_knowledge_update(args: { caller: { agentId: string; agentName: string; clientName: string; clientVersion: string; conversationId: string; modelName: string; modelProvider: string; modelVersion: string; runId: string; sessionId: string; }; context: { id: string; } | { slug: string; }; expectedRevision: number; idempotencyKey: string; learningMetadata?: { [key: string]: unknown; }; markdown: string; skill: { id: string; } | { skillSlug: string; workspaceSlug: string; }; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ contextId: string; knowledge: { baseRevisionId: string | null; createdAt: string; digest: string; id: string; learningMetadata: { [key: string]: unknown; }; markdown: string; revision: number; }; requestId: string; skillId: string; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__skillplane__context_note_upsert\",\"description\":\"Discover, retrieve, and manage versioned Skillplane skills and their authorized context knowledge. Start with workspaces_list, skills_list, and contexts_list when identifiers are unknown. All caller identity fields are declared metadata; authentication remains server-derived.\\n\\nCreate a shared context note at revision one or append its next immutable revision using a stable note ID, required expected revision for updates, and replay-safe idempotency.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__skillplane__context_note_upsert(args: { caller: { agentId: string; agentName: string; clientName: string; clientVersion: string; conversationId: string; modelName: string; modelProvider: string; modelVersion: string; runId: string; sessionId: string; }; context: { id: string; } | { slug: string; }; expectedRevision?: number | null; idempotencyKey: string; learningMetadata?: { [key: string]: unknown; }; markdown: string; noteId?: string | null; skill: { id: string; } | { skillSlug: string; workspaceSlug: string; }; title: string; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ contextId: string; note: { archivedAt: string | null; createdAt: string; currentRevision: { baseRevisionId: string | null; createdAt: string; digest: string; id: string; learningMetadata: { [key: string]: unknown; }; markdown: string; revision: number; }; id: string; slug: string; title: string; updatedAt: string; }; requestId: string; skillId: string; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__skillplane__context_notes_list\",\"description\":\"Discover, retrieve, and manage versioned Skillplane skills and their authorized context knowledge. Start with workspaces_list, skills_list, and contexts_list when identifiers are unknown. All caller identity fields are declared metadata; authentication remains server-derived.\\n\\nList authorized shared context notes in deterministic latest-update order with immutable current revision IDs, digests, Markdown bodies, archive state, and an opaque cursor.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__skillplane__context_notes_list(args: { caller: { agentId: string; agentName: string; clientName: string; clientVersion: string; conversationId: string; modelName: string; modelProvider: string; modelVersion: string; runId: string; sessionId: string; }; context: { id: string; } | { slug: string; }; cursor?: string | null; limit?: number; skill: { id: string; } | { skillSlug: string; workspaceSlug: string; }; state?: \\\"active\\\" | \\\"archived\\\" | \\\"all\\\"; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ contextId: string; nextCursor: string | null; notes: Array<{ archivedAt: string | null; currentRevision: { createdAt: string; digest: string; id: string; markdown: string; revision: number; }; id: string; slug: string; title: string; updatedAt: string; }>; requestId: string; skillId: string; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__skillplane__context_restore\",\"description\":\"Discover, retrieve, a