{"timestamp":"2026-08-31T02:18:51.925Z","ordinal":7736,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a0559c-c295-74f3-8d42-2a431d924117","call_id":"call_GtPeSsbYdDoNyFrJ8VUGeEA9","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 28818)\nTotal output lines: 921\n\n## new_threads\n[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"PRRT_kwDOO5p-Xs6dl7Yw\",\n    \"isResolved\": false,\n    \"isOutdated\": false,\n    \"path\": \"client/components/settings/userPreferences.store.ts\",\n    \"line\": 112,\n    \"originalLine\": 112,\n    \"startLine\": 112,\n    \"originalStartLine\": null,\n    \"comments\": {\n      \"totalCount\": 1,\n      \"nodes\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"PRRC_kwDOO5p-Xs7n7_4c\",\n          \"body\": \"**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Restore writable updates for preference bindings**\\n\\nSvelte compiles assignments and bindings such as those in `SizeFactorSetting`, `AppearanceSettings`, `DateTimeSettings`, and `CmdResults` into calls to `userPreferences.set(...)`, but this replacement exposes only `subscribe`, `get`, and `modify`. When users change sizing, popup blur, time scales, day-start values, or recent commands, the generated handler therefore fails instead of updating and persisting the preference; restore a persistence-aware `set` method or migrate every direct `$userPreferences` assignment.\\n\\nAGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L12-L13](https://github.com/21nCo/nucleum/blob/8739a79ce4f6a6e21399e11a0be93c9011269271/AGENTS.md#L12-L13)\\n\\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"login\": \"chatgpt-codex-connector\"\n          },\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-31T02:10:05Z\",\n          \"updatedAt\": \"2026-08-31T02:10:05Z\",\n          \"outdated\": false,\n          \"url\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/nucleum/pull/570#discussion_r3891265052\",\n          \"diffHunk\": \"@@ -60,60 +61,140 @@ export const seedUserPreferences: IUserGlobalPreferences = {\\n   }\\n };\\n \\n-class UserPreferencesStore extends KeyValueStore<IUserGlobalPreferences> {\\n-  constructor() {\\n-    super(Resource.globalPreferences, seedUserPreferences);\\n-  }\\n+const userPreferencesSignal = datafn.kv.signal<IUserGlobalPreferences>(\\n+  Resource.globalPreferences,\\n+  { defaultValue: seedUserPreferences }\\n+);\\n+const userPreferencesLocal = writable<IUserGlobalPreferences>(\\n+  normalizeUserPreferences(seedUserPreferences)\\n+);\\n+let userPreferencesIsInitialized = false;\\n \\n-  loader(data: IUserGlobalPreferences) {\\n-    if (!data.avatarPicker)\\n-      data.avatarPicker = seedUserPreferences.avatarPicker;\\n-    if (!data.annotations) data.annotations = seedUserPreferences.annotations;\\n-    if (!data.mediaGridTestitems)\\n-      data.mediaGridTestitems = seedUserPreferences.mediaGridTestitems;\\n-    if (data.isAnonymousAnalyticsEnabled === undefined)\\n-      data.isAnonymousAnalyticsEnabled = true;\\n-    const val = {\\n-      ...data\\n-    };\\n-    super.loader(val);\\n-  }\\n+function normalizeUserPreferences(data?: Partial<IUserGlobalPreferences>) {\\n+  const value = data ?? {};\\n+  return {\\n+    ...seedUserPreferences,\\n+    ...value,\\n+    appearance: {\\n+      ...seedUserPreferences.appearance,\\n+      ...(value.appearance ?? {})\\n+    },\\n+    avatarPicker: {\\n+      ...seedUserPreferences.avatarPicker,\\n+      ...(value.avatarPicker ?? {})\\n+    },\\n+    localAI: {\\n+      ...seedUserPreferences.localAI,\\n+      ...(value.localAI ?? {})\\n+    },\\n+    infiniteGrid: {\\n+      ...seedUserPreferences.infiniteGrid,\\n+      ...(value.infiniteGrid ?? {})\\n+    },\\n+    annotations: value.annotations ?? seedUserPreferences.annotations,\\n+    mediaGridTestitems:\\n+      value.mediaGridTestitems ?? seedUserPreferences.mediaGridTestitems,\\n+    isAnonymousAnalyticsEnabled:\\n+      value.isAnonymousAnalyticsEnabled ?? true\\n+  };\\n+}\\n+\\n+userPreferencesSignal.subscribe((value) => {\\n+  userPreferencesIsInitialized = true;\\n+  userPreferencesLocal.set(normalizeUserPreferences(value));\\n+});\\n+\\n+export const userPreferences = {\\n+  seed: seedUserPreferences,\\n+  get isInitialized() {\\n+    return userPreferencesIsInitialized;\\n+  },\\n+  subscribe: userPreferencesLocal.subscribe,\",\n          \"originalLine\": 112,\n          \"line\": 112,\n          \"path\": \"client/components/settings/userPreferences.store.ts\",\n          \"replyTo\": null\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"PRRT_kwDOO5p-Xs6dl7Y1\",\n    \"isResolved\": false,\n    \"isOutdated\": false,\n    \"path\": \"client/stores/actionMap.ts\",\n    \"line\": 606,\n    \"originalLine\": 606,\n    \"startLine\": 606,\n    \"originalStartLine\": null,\n    \"comments\": {\n      \"totalCount\": 1,\n      \"nodes\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"PRRC_kwDOO5p-Xs7n7_4i\",\n          \"body\": \"**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Register the space modal under the generated key**\\n\\nThe fresh evidence in this revision is that the registration is now `combination-create`, while both shared `resourceAction()` implementations and callers such as `ResourceBrowser.addAction()` and `CreateCombination` generate `combination_create` with an underscore. Because the Memotron and Nucleum configurations still expose the legacy `Resource.combination`, selecting New space cannot resolve this modal and `runAction()` navigates to 404; register the generated key or consistently migrate all callers.\\n\\nAGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L6-L7](https://github.com/21nCo/nucleum/blob/8739a79ce4f6a6e21399e11a0be93c9011269271/AGENTS.md#L6-L7)\\n\\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"login\": \"chatgpt-codex-connector\"\n          },\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-31T02:10:05Z\",\n          \"updatedAt\": \"2026-08-31T02:10:05Z\",\n          \"outdated\": false,\n          \"url\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/nucleum/pull/570#discussion_r3891265058\",\n          \"diffHunk\": \"@@ -606,7 +603,7 @@ export const globalActions: IAction[] = [\\n     }\\n   },\\n   {\\n-    action: resourceAction(Resource.combination, ResourceActionType.CREATE),\\n+    action: \\\"combination-create\\\",\",\n          \"originalLine\": 606,\n          \"line\": 606,\n          \"path\": \"client/stores/actionMap.ts\",\n          \"replyTo\": null\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n]\n{\n  \"id\": 5062648213,\n  \"user\": \"pullfrog[bot]\",\n  \"state\": \"COMMENTED\",\n  \"submitted_at\": \"2026-08-31T02:17:24Z\",\n  \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/nucleum/pull/570#pullrequestreview-5062648213\",\n  \"commit_id\": \"8739a79ce4f6a6e21399e11a0be93c9011269271\",\n  \"body\": \"> ℹ️ No new issues found in the incremental delta; the existing Pullfrog `PointLog` fixture requirements remain open.\\n\\n**Reviewed changes** since the previous Pullfrog review, covering the latest runtime and recovery fixes.\\n\\n- **Confirmed backup delivery**: Awaited embedded and browser backup handoff before persisting the recovery decision.\\n- **Restored timezone capture**: Reintroduced focus-driven browser timezone detection through the DataFn temporal store.\\n- **Hardened legacy conversion**: Omitted the `PointGoal:Empty` sentinel relation while retaining valid synthetic sessions for sessionless logs.\\n- **Propagated persistence failures**: Surfaced failed DataFn file metadata mutations and classified unavailable extension sessions as unusable.\\n\\n<!--\\nPullfrog review metadata. These findings were written against 8739a79c;\\nif commits have landed on codex/tidy-442-04-client-runtime-auth since, treat every specific bug, file, or\\nline callout as POTENTIALLY STALE and re-diff before acting on it.\\n\\n- Mode: IncrementalReview (delta against prior pullfrog review)\\n- Files reviewed: 101\\n- Commits reviewed: 13\\n- Base: dev (9971f77d)\\n- Head: codex/tidy-442-04-client-runtime-auth (8739a79c)\\n- Reviewed commits:\\n  - 8739a79c — fix latest PR review findings\\n- Prior pullfrog review: ce677ed4 (https://github.com/21nCo/nucleum/pull/570#pullrequestreview-5062577305)\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ -->\\n<sup><a href=\\\"https://pullfrog.com\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\\\"><img src=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-green-full-18px.png\\\" width=\\\"9px\\\" height=\\\"9px\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: middle; \\\" alt=\\\"Pullfrog\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;｜ [Fix it ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/nucleum/570?action=fix&review_id=5062648213) ｜ [View workflow run](https://github.com/21nCo/nucleum/actions/runs/33349474137/job/99359861256) ｜ Using `GPT Sol` ｜ [𝕏](https://x.com/pullfrogai)</sup>\"\n}\n\n## preferences\nimport { AppSkin, Theme } from \"@21n/types/appearance.type\";\nimport type {\n  IUserGlobalPreferences,\n  UserAppearanceSettings\n} from \"@21n/types/preferences.type\";\nimport { TimeScale } from \"@21n/types/time.type\";\nimport { detectTimeZone, detectTimeZoneFallback } from \"@21n/utils/time.utils\";\nimport { Resource } from \"@21n/data/datafn/resource.enum\";\nimport { TranscriptionModel } from \"@21n/products/memotron/taco/taco.types\";\nimport { tzStore } from \"@21n/components/settings/timezone/tz.store\";\nimport { datafn } from \"@21n/stores/datafn.store\";\nimport { get, writable } from \"svelte/store\";\n\n// const userPreferencesId = Item.globalPreferences;\nconst defaultColorSchemeId = \"colorscheme:clean_tidyblue_light\";\nconst defaultDarkColorSchemeId = \"colorscheme:clean_tidyblue_dark\";\nconst defaultTimeZone = detectTimeZone();\n\nexport const seedUserPreferences: IUserGlobalPreferences = {\n  name: \"\",\n  dayStartHour: 0,\n  dayStartMinute: 0,\n  birthday: new Date(),\n  tempColorScheme: \"scheme1\",\n  accessibilitySizingFactor: 1,\n  timeScales: [TimeScale.DAYS, TimeScale.MONTHS, TimeScale.YEARS],\n  timeFormat: \"meridian\",\n  timeZoneOffset: (defaultTimeZone?.offset ?? 0) * 60,\n  timeZoneLabel: defaultTimeZone?.label ?? \"UTC\",\n  timeZone: defaultTimeZone?.zone ?? \"UTC\",\n  isAnonymousAnalyticsEnabled: true,\n  lastUsedTranscriptionModel: TranscriptionModel.TINY_EN,\n  appearance: {\n    skin: AppSkin.Clean,\n    isSyncWithSystem: true,\n    lightColorSchemeId: defaultColorSchemeId,\n    darkColorSchemeId: defaultDarkColorSchemeId,\n    userThemeSetting: Theme.LIGHT,\n    isBlurredBgForPopups: false,\n    isFixedLeftNav: false,\n    typeface: \"Twenty One Native\"\n  },\n  avatarPicker: {\n    skinIndex: 0,\n    usedEmojis: [],\n    iconColor: \"bw\",\n    filled: false,\n    usedIcons: []\n  },\n  annotations: [],\n  mediaGridTestitems: [],\n  infiniteGrid: {\n    isGridCreated: false,\n    grid: []\n  },\n  localAI: {\n    semanticSearch: false,\n    audioTranscription: false,\n    markdownQAChat: false,\n    vectorGenerationInProgress: false\n  }\n};\n\nconst userPreferencesSignal = datafn.kv.signal<IUserGlobalPreferences>(\n  Resource.globalPreferences,\n  { defaultValue: seedUserPreferences }\n);\nconst userPreferencesLocal = writable<IUserGlobalPreferences>(\n  normalizeUserPreferences(seedUserPreferences)\n);\nlet userPreferencesIsInitialized = false;\n\nfunction normalizeUserPreferences(data?: Partial<IUserGlobalPreferences>) {\n  const value = data ?? {};\n  return {\n    ...seedUserPreferences,\n    ...value,\n    appearance: {\n      ...seedUserPreferences.appearance,\n      ...(value.appearance ?? {})\n    },\n    avatarPicker: {\n      ...seedUserPreferences.avatarPicker,\n      ...(value.avatarPicker ?? {})\n    },\n    localAI: {\n      ...seedUserPreferences.localAI,\n      ...(value.localAI ?? {})\n    },\n    infiniteGrid: {\n      ...seedUserPreferences.infiniteGrid,\n      ...(value.infiniteGrid ?? {})\n    },\n    annotations: value.annotations ?? seedUserPreferences.annotations,\n    mediaGridTestitems:\n      value.mediaGridTestitems ?? seedUserPreferences.mediaGridTestitems,\n    isAnonymousAnalyticsEnabled:\n      value.isAnonymousAnalyticsEnabled ?? true\n  };\n}\n\nuserPreferencesSignal.subscribe((value) => {\n  userPreferencesIsInitialized = true;\n  userPreferencesLocal.set(normalizeUserPreferences(value));\n});\n\nexport const userPreferences = {\n  seed: seedUserPreferences,\n  get isInitialized() {\n    return userPreferencesIsInitialized;\n  },\n  subscribe: userPreferencesLocal.subscribe,\n  get() {\n    return get(userPreferencesLocal);\n  },\n  loader(data: Partial<IUserGlobalPreferences>) {\n    userPreferencesLocal.set(normalizeUserPreferences(data));\n    return datafn.kv.set(\n      Resource.globalPreferences,\n      normalizeUserPreferences(data)\n    );\n  },\n\n  setAppearance(x: Partial<UserAppearanceSettings>) {\n    const n = this.get();\n    const appearance = { ...n.appearance, ...x };\n    this.modify({ appearance });\n  },\n\n  setAvatarPicker(x: Partial<IUserGlobalPreferences[\"avatarPicker\"]>) {\n    const n = this.get();\n    const avatarPicker = { ...n.avatarPicker, ...x };\n    this.modify({ avatarPicker });\n  },\n\n  setLocalAI(x: Partial<IUserGlobalPreferences[\"localAI\"]>) {\n    const n = this.get();\n    const localAI = { ...n.localAI, ...x };\n    this.modify({ localAI });\n  },\n\n  setInfiniteGrid(x: Partial<IUserGlobalPreferences[\"infiniteGrid\"]>) {\n    const n = this.get();\n    const infiniteGrid = { ...n.infiniteGrid, ...x };\n    this.modify({ infiniteGrid });\n  },\n\n  setRecentCommands(recentCommands: IUserGlobalPreferences[\"recentCommands\"]) {\n    this.modify({ recentCommands });\n  },\n\n  setAccessibilitySizingFactor(accessibilitySizingFactor: number) {\n    this.modify({ accessibilitySizingFactor });\n  },\n\n  _setTimezone(offset: number, label?: string, timezone?: string) {\n    this.modify({\n      timeZoneOffset: offset,\n      timeZoneLabel: label,\n      timeZone: timezone\n    });\n    return { offset, label, timezone };\n  },\n  /**\n   * Sets the timezone offset and label for the user\n   * @param offset - The offset of the timezone from UTC in seconds\n   * @param label - The label of the timezone\n   * @returns\n   */\n  async setTimeZone(offset?: number, label?: string, timezone?: string) {\n    let source = \"manual\";\n    if (offset === undefined) {\n      const val = detectTimeZoneFallback();\n      offset = val.offset;\n      label = val.label;\n      timezone = detectTimeZone()?.zone ?? tzStore.resolveTimezone();\n      source = \"browser\";\n    }\n    const resolvedTimezone =\n      timezone ?? label?.split(\" (UTC\")[0] ?? tzStore.resolveTimezone();\n    await tzStore.setTimezone(resolvedTimezone, source);\n    return this._setTimezone(offset, label, resolvedTimezone);\n  },\n\n  updateUserProfile(x: Partial<IUserGlobalPreferences>) {\n    this.modify({ ...x });\n  },\n\n  modify(n: Partial<IUserGlobalPreferences>) {\n    userPreferencesLocal.update((current) =>\n      normalizeUserPreferences({ ...current, ...n })\n    );\n    return datafn.kv.merge(Resource.globalPreferences, n);\n  },\n\n  destroy() {\n    userPreferencesSignal.dispose();\n    tzStore.destroy();\n  }\n};\n\n## action_map\n    isMeta: true,\n    type: ActionType.MODAL,\n    modalParams: {\n      layout: {\n        size: Size.xxl,\n        orientation: Orientation.Horizontal\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    action: \"signaldb-console\",\n    component: SignalDBViewer,\n    isMeta: true,\n    type: ActionType.MODAL,\n    modalParams: {\n      layout: {\n        size: Size.xxl,\n        orientation: Orientation.Horizontal\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    action: Action.GO_BACK,\n    label: \"Go back\",\n    isMeta: true,\n    type: ActionType.FUNCTION,\n    fn: async () => {\n      appStore.goBack();\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    action: Action.GO_FORWARD,\n    label: 