gs/userPreferences.store.ts:78` — stores pending entries in one process-global map. - `client/components/settings/userPreferences.store.ts:109-115` — reapplies every unmatched pending entry after any namespace's signal update. - `client/components/settings/userPreferences.store.ts:138-142` — derives a persisted nested value from the potentially overlaid store. - `client/stores/account.store.ts:233` — destroys DataFn on sign-out without resetting this pending state. ## Required outcome - Pending user-preference entries must never be applied outside the DataFn namespace that created them. - Preserve per-mutation rollback behavior and cover a namespace switch while a preference write remains unacknowledged. ```` </details>\nclient/stores/datafn.store.ts\t603\t2026-08-31T02:33:49Z\tcoderabbitai\tfa3b44579e8902366c0c170f9988949cb1c58311\tfalse\thttps://github.com/21nCo/nucleum/pull/570#discussion_r3891339508\t_🗄️ Data Integrity & Integration_ | _🟠 Major_ | _🏗️ Heavy lift_ <details> <summary>🔎 Supported by static analysis</summary> 🏁 Script executed: ```shell #!/bin/bash set -e printf '%s\\\\n' '--- applicable repository conventions ---' find /tmp/coderabbit-repo-knowledge/21nco-nucleum-01ac9b00 -type f -name '*.md' -maxdepth 3 -print printf '%s\\\\n' '--- changed hunk ---' sed -n '540,630p' client/stores/datafn.store.ts printf '%s\\\\n' '--- direct definitions and calls ---' rg -n -C 4 'writeRemoteDatafnE2eeSettings|clearDatafnE2eeRecovery|recoveryRequired|initializeNucleumDatafn|datafn.*(set|put|update)|remote.*(revision|version)' client shared ``` Repository: 21nCo/nucleum Length of output: 33605 --- 🏁 Script executed: ```shell #!/bin/bash set -e printf '%s\\\\n' '--- client conventions ---' cat /tmp/coderabbit-repo-knowledge/21nco-nucleum-01ac9b00/conventions/client.md printf '%s\\\\n' '--- repository-wide conventions ---' cat /tmp/coderabbit-repo-knowledge/21nco-nucleum-01ac9b00/conventions/repo-wide.md printf '%s\\\\n' '--- remote settings helpers and imports ---' s