 line 597-603: Update the recovery flow around readRemoteDatafnE2eeSettings and writeRemoteDatafnE2eeSettings to use an atomic compare-and-set or equivalent revision check before persisting restoredSettings. Preserve the recovery marker, and reject or surface a conflict when the remote E2EE record has changed since it was read instead of overwriting newer keyRef, wrapping metadata, or updatedAt values. In `@client/stores/datafnE2ee.store.ts`: - Line 12: Move NucleumDatafnE2eeSettings from client/stores/datafnE2ee.store.ts into client/types, preserving its persisted recovery contract, and update consumers to import it. Also move OptimisticKvEntry and OptimisticKvEntries from client/stores/optimisticKv.utils.ts into client/types and import them from there. In `@client/stores/optimisticKv.utils.ts`: - Line 10: Remove the newly added inline JSDoc comments in the optimistic KV utility, including the comments near the affected entry-processing logic, while leaving the implementation unchanged. --- Outside diff comments: In `@client/stores/actionMap.ts`: - Line 690: Update the callback around addDatafnRecordToCollection so a result of 0 is treated as a no-op: show the existing-record message and return without reporting item as added. Preserve the current success behavior for nonzero results. ``` </details> <details> <summary>🪄 Autofix</summary> Fix all unresolved CodeRabbit comments on this PR: - [ ] <!-- {\"checkboxId\":\"4b0d0e0a-96d7-4f10-b296-3a18ea78f0b9\"} --> Push a commit to this branch (recommended) - [ ] <!-- {\"checkboxId\":\"ff5b1114-7d8c-49e6-8ac1-43f82af23a33\"} --> Create a new PR with the fixes </details> --- <details> <summary>ℹ️ Review info</summary> <details> <summary>⚙️ Run configuration</summary> **Configuration used**: defaults **Review profile**: CHILL **Plan**: Pro Plus **Run ID**: `0a1ee6ae-736a-4873-baaf-65f7b770d78e` </details> <details> <summary>📥 Commits</summary> Reviewing files that changed from the base of the PR and between 0383892256c226c