{"timestamp":"2026-08-31T03:01:50.056Z","ordinal":9013,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_07a651664efba6ab016a94ee9bd23487d08158ef6363dc7ebe","status":"completed","call_id":"call_oI8U2kZIggi0ZGkw3Gxtv3BM","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.update_plan({explanation:\"Completed the bounded refetch-fix round for PR #570 and pushed one validated fix batch. Per the cached Skillplane contract, post-push review feedback must be fetched only in the next fresh round.\",plan:[{step:\"Pin PR #570 worktree, branch, live head, and cleanliness\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{step:\"Wait for all review producers on the pinned head\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{step:\"Snapshot and classify every unresolved review thread\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{step:\"Apply, validate, commit, and push one bounded fix batch\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{step:\"Run the next fresh refetch round, then merge and advance the stack\",\"status\":\"pending\"}]});\ntext(r);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a055b1-b0ee-7061-8828-4da29bf187dc","create_time":1788145304.853283}}}
