verse-order rollback. - **Scoped legacy diagnostics**: Kept legacy API inventory state module-local in production and exposed its accessor only in tests. - **Removed stale UI code**: Deleted inactive comments from preferences and trail rendering. <!-- Pullfrog review metadata. These findings were written against 2e46d625; if commits have landed on codex/tidy-442-04-client-runtime-auth since, treat every specific bug, file, or line callout as POTENTIALLY STALE and re-diff before acting on it. - Mode: IncrementalReview (delta against prior pullfrog review) - Files reviewed: 102 - Commits reviewed: 16 - Base: dev (9971f77d) - Head: codex/tidy-442-04-client-runtime-auth (2e46d625) - Reviewed commits:   - 2e46d625 — fix remaining PR 570 review findings   - 64885893 — fix fresh PR review findings   - fa3b4457 — fix latest PR review findings   - 8739a79c — fix latest PR review findings   - ce677ed4 — fix remaining PR review findings   - 03838922 — fix: close latest PR review findings   - 91a40ab5 — fix: close remaining runtime review gaps   - 9aadca2e — fix: preserve recovery routing contracts   - bd15cad2 — fix: preserve staged migration continuity   - 04332816 — fix: preserve staged runtime migration safety   - 2d59ba57 — fix: address current PR review findings   - d6d85ebd — fix: address latest PR review findings   - 589009fc — fix: address PR 570 review findings   - 0c1c83f2 — Resolve client runtime workspace dependencies   - 0ef6476c — Migrate web authentication to AuthFn client   - de61020e — Replace legacy client persistence with DataFn runtime - Prior pullfrog review: 64885893 (https://github.com/21nCo/nucleum/pull/570#pullrequestreview-5062772766) --> <!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ --> <sup><a href=\"https://pullfrog.com\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\"><img src=\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-green-full-18px.png\" width=\"9px\" height=\"9px\" style=\"vertical-align: