e local flag. - `client/stores/datafn.store.ts:624-629` — forces E2EE onto storage-backed mode without persisting the effective offlinability value. - `client/components/account/auth.ts:208-221` — rejects cached cloud sessions whenever the stored flag remains `false`. ## Required outcome - When E2EE requires local storage, persist or otherwise expose that effective state to cached-session auth before an offline launch. - Render the disabled switch as enabled and cover the `stored false + remote E2EE + offline restart` path with a regression test. ```` </details>\n"},"started_at_ms":1788145991810,"completed_at_ms":1788145991810}}
