e immediately above has already cleared the cached plan and this condition treats the missing response as a failed entitlement. Entitled Nucleum users are consequently redirected to access denied despite the newly persiste\n14\tclient/layout/layers/BaseLayer.svelte\t461\t2026-08-30T19:08:22Z\tchatgpt-codex-connector\t2e46d625da\tfalse\thttps://github.com/21nCo/nucleum/pull/570#discussion_r3890269351\t**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Preserve manual offline mode across connectivity events** When a user has explicitly enabled offline mode and the browser reconnects, this handler derives `isOffline` solely from `navigator.onLine`, overwrites the stored-mode state, and switches DataFn back to sync. The reconnect can therefore upload locally queued changes despite the user's offline-mode selection; combine network state with `ClientStorageKey.OFFLINE_MODE` befor\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a055c4-948d-7b90-8dbf-b059d8086b3b","create_time":1788146003.944721}}}
