ents</summary>  ```text Check if this issue is valid — if so, un\nclient/layout/layers/UserBaseLayer.svelte\t0\t<!-- cubic:v=07a86f80-fa7b-4a58-a6db-0c9e3994c327 --> <!-- cubic:review-run=7522f186-2360-43cc-b9ce-632214bd3d94 --> <!-- metadata:{\"confidence\":10} --> P2: After the new DataFn startup path runs, recent records are never initialized or added. Existing `appStore.addToRecents` callers still dispatch events, so Library/search recents stay empty; restore recents initialization and event handling against the active persistence layer before signaling startup ready.  <details> <summary>Prompt for AI a\nclient/components/settings/sync/SyncStatus.svelte\t0\t<!-- cubic:v=1be13444-2bad-44c2-aff1-c8b0e3f38099 --> <!-- cubic:review-run=7522f186-2360-43cc-b9ce-632214bd3d94 --> <!-- metadata:{\"confidence\":7} --> P2: Replacing `formatDatetime($userPreferences, new Date(+lastSyncedAt))` with `new Date(lastSyncedAt).toLocaleString()` drops the user's time-format preference (24h vs meridian) and configured timezone, so the \"Last synced at\" label no longer matches the rest of the app. Restore the preference-aware formatter, which is still available via `forma\nclient/stores/datafn.store.ts\t0\t<!-- cubic:v=5771ef8e-69e6-4048-83e7-0912a826bcab --> <!-- cubic:review-run=7522f186-2360-43cc-b9ce-632214bd3d94 --> <!-- metadata:{\"confidence\":9} --> P2: If `listRecords(\"node\")` temporarily fails, this fallback records a completed migration without converting any nodes. Let the read error abort initialization so the migration retries, rather than writing the marker after a failed read.  <details> <summary>Prompt for AI agents</summary>  ```text Check if this issue is valid — if so, understand\nclient/layout/layers/cache/InMemoryCache.svelte\t24\t<!-- cubic:v=f38d7704-b358-40d6-98f5-36a7f67b47d7 --> <!-- cubic:review-run=7522f186-2360-43cc-b9ce-632214bd3d94 --> <!-- metadata:{\"confidence\":6} --> P2: This change stops the resource count caches from being populated. Resourc