{"timestamp":"2026-08-31T03:18:59.393Z","ordinal":9446,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a053e7-239f-7703-8a5b-d9d8ac22d6de","turn_id":"01a055c4-948d-7b90-8dbf-b059d8086b3b","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_07a651664efba6ab016a94f2a1ddbc87d098a8e7b937f530b8","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The fixes stay within existing architecture: backup flows will wait for the actual native handoff, app-menu writes will use the same optimistic rollback helper as other KV stores, E2EE will persist its required offline mode, legacy conversion will preserve node structure and valid objective defaults, and host file reads will follow the DataFn records already written by uploads while extensions retain their legacy transport."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788146337942,"completed_at_ms":1788146339393}}
